    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Tervetuloa! Haluatko apua?",
      "translation": "Welcome! Do you want help?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Kyll\u00e4, olisi kiva n\u00e4hd\u00e4 laitteet.",
      "translation": "Yes, it would be nice to see the equipment."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "T\u00e4ss\u00e4 on kuntosali. T\u00e4\u00e4ll\u00e4 on kaikki tarpeellinen.",
      "translation": "Here is the gym. Everything needed is here."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Hienoa! Mihin laitteisiin pit\u00e4isi keskitty\u00e4?",
      "translation": "Great! Which equipment should I focus on?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Aloita penkist\u00e4 ja py\u00f6ristyksest\u00e4.",
      "translation": "Start with the bench and deadlift."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Kuinka paljon painoja suosittelette?",
      "translation": "How much weight do you recommend?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Aloita kevyest\u00e4 ja lis\u00e4\u00e4 v\u00e4hitellen.",
      "translation": "Start light and increase gradually."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Hyv\u00e4 idea. Ent\u00e4 juoksumatto?",
      "translation": "Good idea. What about the treadmill?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Juoksumatto on tuolla. Voit k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 sit\u00e4 l\u00e4mmittelyyn.",
      "translation": "The treadmill is over there. You can use it for warming up."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Kiitos! Treenaako sin\u00e4 usein?",
      "translation": "Thank you! Do you train often?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Kyll\u00e4, kolme kertaa viikossa.",
      "translation": "Yes, three times a week."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Se on hyv\u00e4 rutiini.",
      "translation": "That is a good routine."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Kyll\u00e4. Olemme l\u00e4hes valmiita.",
      "translation": "Yes. We are almost ready."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Kiitos avustasi! Tuntuu hyv\u00e4lt\u00e4.",
